title: fireStopper_workshop
color: green
position: -273,58
---
Safety first of course.
What do they call them on Earth again..?
-> Fire Extinguishers
	So sofisticated.
-> Flame Quenchers
	Like a dwarf killing a dragon.
-> Fire Snuffer
	Like a drugger, snuffing all that fire.
Why can't they just say Fire Stopper like us?
===

title: sputnik_workshop
color: green
position: -273,58
---
Wait... is that a SPUTNIK satelite! What is it doing here?
-> Maybe someone is making replicas here?
-> The kind of trash you can find here.
	Speaking of trash.. This is an impressive trash pile they amassed over here. 
===

