---
Yes. This is a proper trash pile.
Damn... I think there is a High Power Radio module behind these old gas tanks.
Wish there was a way to get to it...
===

title: thermos_workshop
color: green
position: -273,58
---
I think dad had the same thermos when I was a child.
-> The best Kallisto industries can provide!
	I remember that it could keep a liter of soup scolding hot for at least 10 hours. How many times did I burn myself with that shit...
===

