title: uglyStatue_Office
color: green
position: -273,58
---
I think this is supposed to be a statue...
-> I don't like it.
	But every office needs an ugly piece of art.
	Maybe there is something to enjoy about it?
	Hmm...
	I think enjoy the shape... the ball.
	A lot of meaning hidden in there I'm sure.
-> It's okay.
	Kinda boring but I think that's what you need in an office setting.
	No distractions.
-> I love it.
	The shape. The color. It speaks to me!
	I would love to meet the artist that made this.
	We could talk about balls.
===

title: probe_Office
color: green
position: -273,58
---
What an interesting artefact to keep in your office.
It looks like one of the Iovita probes sent here nearly 70 years ago...
This must have been hard to get.
-> Do I remember anything about that?
	I think the Martian government sent around fourty of these here. They where surveying the moons for possible habitat and industrial spots.
	Many of them actually ended up frying in the radioation belt while trying to analise Io.
	A true land of the dead if even the robots can't survive there.
-> True piece of history.
	Even smells like history.
===

