title: DadBody
---
<<if $dadBody == false>>
	You look at the black cryosuit that contains your dad.
	-> This is wrong, I should have got here in time. 
		Dad: I'm sorry kid... that's space for you.
		The voice in your head somehow seems even more real with his body in front of you.
		Dad: One minor inconvenience and you're a week late...
		<<if mental_check(15)>>
			You manage to hold back your tears, you've a job to do.
		<<elseif true>>
			You clean the tears from your face.
		<<endif>>
		<<declare $dadBody = false>>
        <<set $dadBody = true>>
<<elseif true>>
	The body is still there staring at you.
<<endif>>
===
